1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 26=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:29,199
(Life is but a journey,
and I too am a traveler.)

7
00:04:29,199 --> 00:04:30,319
I know

8
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:34,000
you have no feelings for me

9
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:40,000
and were only going along
with your parents' wishes.

10
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:44,800
I thought that since
we shared similar interests,

11
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:47,360
if we treated each other sincerely,

12
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,959
affection would surely grow with time.

13
00:04:53,079 --> 00:04:54,639
Now, I'm actually glad

14
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,000
that this marriage

15
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:02,160
was only something I wanted.

16
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,800
Your heart

17
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:08,160
should be free.

18
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:14,900
♪My thoughts are like a red umbrella♪

19
00:05:15,620 --> 00:05:17,540
♪Drifting through the rain♪

20
00:05:17,940 --> 00:05:22,820
♪Held tightly in my hand,
shielding me from hidden currents♪

21
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:28,100
♪Yet fate stains my sleeves with blood♪

22
00:05:28,260 --> 00:05:32,700
♪Raindrops fall,
one by one, into my dreams♪

23
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,120
Tomorrow,

24
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,040
I'll be returning to the academy.

25
00:05:42,824 --> 00:05:45,080
Once I've finished
the provincial examination this fall,

26
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,560
I'll come back.

27
00:05:49,300 --> 00:05:54,660
♪With guilt in my heart,
how could I ask to meet again?♪

28
00:05:56,660 --> 00:06:01,540
♪May I be like
a firefly awakening in the dark♪

29
00:06:01,700 --> 00:06:06,860
♪Even if I only cast light
on one cycle of bloom and decay♪

30
00:06:06,860 --> 00:06:12,060
♪If only I could move someone's heart♪

31
00:06:12,740 --> 00:06:17,500
♪I'd spend every dawn
and dusk to see it through♪

32
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:22,620
♪May I be like
a firefly awakening in the dark♪

33
00:06:22,620 --> 00:06:28,260
♪Even if I
only illuminate a single corner♪

34
00:06:28,620 --> 00:06:33,620
♪If I could bring light
to someone's eyes♪

35
00:06:33,620 --> 00:06:35,304
(Heaven and earth are an endless
journey, and the fleeting years)

36
00:06:35,310 --> 00:06:37,090
(but passing travelers.
How could I alone remain still?)

37
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:41,460
♪I'd spend this life
and call it courage♪

38
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,680
With a true friend anywhere
in the world,

39
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:50,040
any place can feel like home.

40
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,360
This is where we part.

41
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:03,240
Take care

42
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:05,319
of yourself.

43
00:07:05,319 --> 00:07:09,340
♪May I be like
a firefly awakening in the dark♪

44
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:14,860
♪Even if I
only illuminate a single corner♪

45
00:07:14,860 --> 00:07:19,700
♪If I could bring light
to someone's eyes♪

46
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:31,620
♪I'd spend this life
and call it courage♪

47
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:49,256
(This amulet is for Jinqi, isn't it?)

48
00:07:49,288 --> 00:07:51,800
(Invite the Lin family over
on the pretext of a tea gathering.)

49
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:54,000
(Does the Lin family intend
to break off the engagement?)

50
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,279
(So you can meet with Jinqi.)

51
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,600
(I fear the Lin family is eager)

52
00:07:56,879 --> 00:07:58,639
(Lin)
(to have you marry into their family.)

53
00:07:59,784 --> 00:08:02,240
(Letter of Dissolution)
(Their birth dates are incompatible.)

54
00:08:02,959 --> 00:08:04,959
(Forcing this union)

55
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:07,040
(may only breed resentment)

56
00:08:07,624 --> 00:08:09,160
(and turn affection into bitterness.)

57
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,720
The Lin family has gone too far!

58
00:08:17,319 --> 00:08:19,920
We hereby agree
to dissolve the engagement

59
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:23,079
and each seek a more suitable match.

60
00:08:26,519 --> 00:08:27,600
From this day forward,

61
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:31,160
there shall be
no further ties between us.

62
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:35,000
May we never

63
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,519
bear resentment toward each other.

64
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:57,540
(One Month Later)

65
00:08:58,060 --> 00:09:02,340
(Legacy and Glory)

66
00:09:14,799 --> 00:09:16,320
Do you know what you did wrong?

67
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,159
I do.

68
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,440
What did you do wrong?

69
00:09:24,056 --> 00:09:26,328
I petitioned His Majesty
for an imperial marriage decree.

70
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:29,080
My third son-in-law is now

71
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:31,200
Commander of the Rear Military Command,

72
00:09:31,256 --> 00:09:32,630
and through him, my third daughter

73
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,679
has also received
a First-Rank honorary title.

74
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,399
You wretched fool!

75
00:09:36,424 --> 00:09:38,300
What should have been
a tremendous achievement

76
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,679
was squandered on marrying a maid.

77
00:09:39,740 --> 00:09:41,688
You've made us
the laughingstock of Jinling City

78
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:43,679
and utterly disgraced me.

79
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,288
I don't even dare show my face outside!

80
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:47,559
How can you face
the grandfather who raised you?

81
00:09:47,656 --> 00:09:48,936
(Legacy and Glory)
How can you

82
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:50,472
face the ancestors of the Lin family?

83
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:55,519
You knew your mother
was arranging a marriage for you.

84
00:09:55,879 --> 00:09:59,840
Why didn't you tell your parents
and elders how you felt?

85
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:02,919
I love Young Lady Xu

86
00:10:03,639 --> 00:10:04,720
and want to marry her.

87
00:10:05,448 --> 00:10:07,360
I knew parents and elders
would never agree,

88
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,399
so I came up with this plan

89
00:10:09,848 --> 00:10:11,360
to bypass the elders of the family

90
00:10:11,496 --> 00:10:13,816
and petition His Majesty
directly for an imperial decree.

91
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:17,960
You unfilial son.

92
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,399
Look at the unfilial son you've raised!

93
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:25,704
For your own selfish desires,

94
00:10:25,752 --> 00:10:27,736
you arranged your marriage
without telling us,

95
00:10:27,919 --> 00:10:29,720
disregarding the family's reputation

96
00:10:29,848 --> 00:10:31,750
and everything
your parents have done for you.

97
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:34,360
This is a grave act of filial impiety!

98
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,559
If you're not severely punished today,

99
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:42,220
our descendants
will follow your example,

100
00:10:42,230 --> 00:10:45,048
and the natural order and moral bonds
will surely be thrown into chaos.

101
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,399
Bring out the family rod!

102
00:11:07,340 --> 00:11:09,940
♪The golden sunset♪

103
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:13,500
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

104
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:17,540
♪All things fall silent♪

105
00:11:17,540 --> 00:11:20,860
♪Fearing to disturb this moment♪

106
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:24,620
♪My restless heart
seeks a place to anchor♪

107
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:27,600
Strike him!

108
00:11:29,340 --> 00:11:34,860
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

109
00:11:37,420 --> 00:11:40,900
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

110
00:11:40,900 --> 00:11:44,500
♪Lightly traced cause and effect♪

111
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:51,060
♪Half a lifetime of longing
returns to this moment♪

112
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:55,100
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

113
00:11:55,460 --> 00:11:58,980
♪If the image isn't real,
what does it matter?♪

114
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:04,860
♪I still remember your name♪

115
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:09,140
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

116
00:12:09,140 --> 00:12:13,540
♪For withholding its light♪

117
00:12:14,380 --> 00:12:17,780
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

118
00:12:17,780 --> 00:12:21,300
♪Still live and thrive♪

119
00:12:21,820 --> 00:12:26,300
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

120
00:12:26,300 --> 00:12:29,260
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

121
00:12:29,260 --> 00:12:33,420
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

122
00:12:33,780 --> 00:12:37,140
♪You and I will walk there together♪

123
00:12:37,140 --> 00:12:40,820
♪I no longer
search through old dreams♪

124
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:43,660
♪Leaving them buried
deep within the years♪

125
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:48,220
♪I only long to journey
through the night together♪

126
00:12:48,220 --> 00:12:51,420
♪Toward where my heart leads♪

127
00:12:52,140 --> 00:12:56,660
♪I no longer lament
that fate is hard to foresee♪

128
00:12:56,660 --> 00:12:59,660
♪Accepting the unexpected as ordinary♪

129
00:12:59,660 --> 00:13:03,700
♪I only wish the road
behind us would fade like mist♪

130
00:13:03,700 --> 00:13:09,460
♪And we would share the road home♪

131
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,840
Third Young Lady is back!

132
00:13:51,919 --> 00:13:53,759
Grandfather. Grandmother.

133
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,759
Father. Mother.

134
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,519
Uncle. Aunt.

135
00:13:57,848 --> 00:13:59,768
May fortune
and blessings be yours today.

136
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:26,280
Third Young Lady
doesn't come home often.

137
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,159
Hurry and bring her some tea.

138
00:14:28,630 --> 00:14:30,056
Please come inside and have a seat.

139
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,279
My fault.

140
00:14:31,559 --> 00:14:32,919
I heard Jinqi was back,

141
00:14:33,039 --> 00:14:34,600
and I rushed over

142
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,919
without even sending word first.

143
00:14:43,759 --> 00:14:44,720
Let's go inside.

144
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:17,120
Everyone else may leave.

145
00:15:30,180 --> 00:15:33,350
(Pride and Arrogance)

146
00:15:33,759 --> 00:15:34,799
That scared me to death.

147
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,240
My legs are still weak.

148
00:15:39,096 --> 00:15:41,640
I was terrified Jinqi would be beaten
so badly he'd be crippled.

149
00:15:41,879 --> 00:15:43,159
Thank goodness Xiuru arrived...

150
00:15:44,039 --> 00:15:44,840
Jinqi...

151
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:46,360
Jinqiao, be careful.

152
00:15:49,399 --> 00:15:50,840
Even if Xiuru hadn't come,

153
00:15:51,279 --> 00:15:53,039
Jinqi wouldn't have ended up crippled.

154
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:54,879
I already had a plan.

155
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:56,360
I'd pretend my stomach hurt

156
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:58,904
and roll around on the floor,
wailing at the top of my lungs.

157
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,279
Old Madam dotes on me.

158
00:16:00,279 --> 00:16:01,720
She'd surely panic

159
00:16:01,848 --> 00:16:03,256
and start crying and shouting.

160
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:06,159
That's a good plan.

161
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:07,399
It would definitely work.

162
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,759
That little head of yours

163
00:16:10,039 --> 00:16:10,799
is pretty clever.

164
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:12,279
Go sit over there.

165
00:16:14,519 --> 00:16:15,120
Jinlan,

166
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:17,272
you were about
to pretend to faint, weren't you?

167
00:16:17,639 --> 00:16:19,320
I saw you put your hand over your chest.

168
00:16:21,879 --> 00:16:23,639
I was frightened out of my wits, too.

169
00:16:23,919 --> 00:16:24,799
I should have realized

170
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:27,176
Jinqi would have arranged
for someone to come to his rescue.

171
00:16:27,399 --> 00:16:29,960
And the best person for that
was naturally Xiuru.

172
00:16:32,159 --> 00:16:34,440
No wonder Xiuru
arrived at just the right time.

173
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,279
Right on cue.

174
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:41,200
So Xiuru was the one
Jinqi called in to save him?

175
00:16:41,519 --> 00:16:43,039
You're only figuring that out now?

176
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,039
Third Young Lady.

177
00:16:45,272 --> 00:16:46,480
I hadn't come through the door

178
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:48,280
when I heard Jinqiao
making a fuss about me.

179
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,559
Xiuru and Xiushu are here.

180
00:16:52,159 --> 00:16:53,720
He's praising you for saving Jinqi.

181
00:16:55,039 --> 00:16:55,840
Jinqi.

182
00:16:57,759 --> 00:16:58,759
How is Mother?

183
00:16:59,704 --> 00:17:02,760
Mother has always been proud
and cared deeply about her reputation.

184
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:05,359
She placed all her hopes on you.

185
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,650
You arranged your marriage
without telling her,

186
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:09,079
so naturally, she's upset.

187
00:17:11,319 --> 00:17:13,720
But I've already tried to comfort her.

188
00:17:13,730 --> 00:17:15,730
This marriage was bestowed
by His Majesty himself.

189
00:17:15,740 --> 00:17:17,320
There's no other honor like it here.

190
00:17:17,330 --> 00:17:19,190
If any gossip dares
wag their tongue about it,

191
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:20,920
they're questioning
His Majesty's decree.

192
00:17:20,968 --> 00:17:22,270
They'll pay dearly for that.

193
00:17:23,528 --> 00:17:26,570
It's only been a few days, and I already
have to see you in a whole new light.

194
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,480
Xiuru, you really are a Marchioness now.

195
00:17:32,839 --> 00:17:34,200
Some of my drinking companions

196
00:17:34,200 --> 00:17:35,680
made fun of me over this before.

197
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:37,640
I got so angry
that I got into a fight with them.

198
00:17:37,759 --> 00:17:39,680
If I'd learned that line
from Xiuru sooner,

199
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,150
I wouldn't have needed to fight them.

200
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:42,359
Look what they did to me.

201
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:47,240
If you know they're just drinking
companions, why keep seeing them?

202
00:17:48,119 --> 00:17:48,759
All right.

203
00:17:49,799 --> 00:17:51,119
Jinqi, does it hurt?

204
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,240
No.

205
00:17:53,928 --> 00:17:55,780
Jinqi, take good care
of yourself and recover.

206
00:17:55,799 --> 00:17:56,920
Don't worry about Mother.

207
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:58,440
I'll study hard,

208
00:17:58,559 --> 00:18:00,680
tell Mother jokes
and massage her legs every day,

209
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:01,992
and keep her in good spirits.

210
00:18:02,359 --> 00:18:03,839
I also have a parrot

211
00:18:04,279 --> 00:18:05,880
that's especially good at talking.

212
00:18:06,350 --> 00:18:08,744
And lately, Mother has been making me
study for the exams,

213
00:18:08,776 --> 00:18:10,310
so I haven't had time to play with it.

214
00:18:10,519 --> 00:18:12,000
I'll take it to Rongzhang House.

215
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:14,279
I'm sure First Madam
will be delighted.

216
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:16,039
Xiushu.

217
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:19,319
I'll make faces for Aunt Shunhua.

218
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:21,960
Old Madam always laughs
when I make faces.

219
00:18:22,839 --> 00:18:24,559
If she doesn't like this one,

220
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,799
then I'll do this one instead.

221
00:18:27,799 --> 00:18:30,220
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

222
00:18:31,220 --> 00:18:34,500
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

223
00:18:35,500 --> 00:18:39,460
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

224
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:43,580
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

225
00:18:44,020 --> 00:18:47,580
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

226
00:18:48,820 --> 00:18:52,100
♪And the worries
etched between our brows♪

227
00:18:53,340 --> 00:18:57,580
♪Birds carry twigs into the distance♪

228
00:18:57,580 --> 00:19:00,700
♪While two pairs of eyes
watch from below♪

229
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:01,759
Let's go together.

230
00:19:02,079 --> 00:19:03,160
I think you did well, too.

231
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:04,759
All right.

232
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,310
Jinqi needs some peace and quiet.

233
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,519
Why don't you all come to my place

234
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:11,160
and let your second sister-in-law
make you some fresh tea?

235
00:19:11,519 --> 00:19:12,839
I've been thinking about her, too.

236
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:15,039
We haven't had a chance to talk in ages.

237
00:19:15,039 --> 00:19:16,119
I'd like to go see her.

238
00:19:17,079 --> 00:19:17,559
Jinqi,

239
00:19:17,759 --> 00:19:18,680
we're leaving.

240
00:19:18,839 --> 00:19:19,799
Get plenty of rest.

241
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:23,200
Jinqi, get plenty of rest.

242
00:19:30,240 --> 00:19:31,960
Why are you still sitting here?

243
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:32,920
Go on.

244
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:34,119
Jinqi, I'll come see you later.

245
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:35,240
Remember to apply your medicine.

246
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,200
You'll recover more slowly if you don't.

247
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:36,599
I know.

248
00:19:36,599 --> 00:19:38,480
All right, enough. Stop fussing.

249
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:06,559
Young Master.

250
00:20:07,279 --> 00:20:08,559
Shall I put it here?

251
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:20,039
Are Jiugao and Nanke

252
00:20:20,599 --> 00:20:21,519
still being punished?

253
00:20:23,544 --> 00:20:26,120
Yes. They're kneeling outside
Old Master's room as punishment.

254
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:27,640
They'll be fine.

255
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,839
Uncle Geng will plead for them.

256
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,599
I wasn't worried about him.

257
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:40,359
By the way,

258
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:42,400
find a capable servant

259
00:20:42,664 --> 00:20:44,790
to take the gifts
I brought back from the capital

260
00:20:45,039 --> 00:20:46,160
to Lanxiang's family.

261
00:20:46,599 --> 00:20:47,559
Tell them

262
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:49,480
they're for Uncle Xu and Aunt Xu.

263
00:20:50,119 --> 00:20:51,000
And based on

264
00:20:51,359 --> 00:20:52,799
what Lanxiang usually likes,

265
00:20:52,840 --> 00:20:54,400
prepare some things she uses every day

266
00:20:54,472 --> 00:20:55,680
and send them along as well.

267
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:57,200
Yes.

268
00:20:58,920 --> 00:20:59,519
Yuchan.

269
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:02,279
What do you

270
00:21:04,079 --> 00:21:05,039
make of all this?

271
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:10,759
As maids,

272
00:21:11,359 --> 00:21:13,680
our fates are in our masters' hands.

273
00:21:14,056 --> 00:21:16,376
When First Madam was arranging
a marriage for Young Master,

274
00:21:16,559 --> 00:21:18,079
I was very nervous.

275
00:21:18,599 --> 00:21:20,559
Now that I know it's settled
on Young Lady Xu,

276
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:24,200
after the initial shock,
I actually feel relieved.

277
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:27,720
Rather than serve a Young Madam whose
character I know nothing about,

278
00:21:28,599 --> 00:21:30,839
I'd naturally prefer
Young Lady Xu to become our madam.

279
00:21:34,640 --> 00:21:35,680
Don't worry, Young Master.

280
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:39,119
Young Lady Xu saved my life,

281
00:21:39,359 --> 00:21:41,079
and she's the Young Madam you've chosen.

282
00:21:41,680 --> 00:21:42,440
From now on,

283
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:44,599
I'll serve her faithfully.

284
00:21:49,016 --> 00:21:50,000
Go on with your work.

285
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:51,240
Yuan...

286
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:52,079
Commander Yuan!

287
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:53,240
Commander Yuan!

288
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:54,319
Commander Yuan!

289
00:22:56,160 --> 00:22:57,359
I lost my senses for a moment

290
00:22:57,400 --> 00:22:58,490
and made a terrible mistake.

291
00:22:58,640 --> 00:23:00,559
Please give me a chance
to redeem myself.

292
00:23:01,736 --> 00:23:02,960
I want to expose Prince Han!

293
00:23:04,519 --> 00:23:05,480
To maintain his troops,

294
00:23:05,500 --> 00:23:07,100
he secretly colluded with the Wo people

295
00:23:07,110 --> 00:23:08,328
and made enormous profits.

296
00:23:10,472 --> 00:23:11,720
If you bring down Prince Han,

297
00:23:11,832 --> 00:23:13,720
that would be
an extraordinary achievement.

298
00:23:14,680 --> 00:23:15,880
All I ask is to live.

299
00:23:16,039 --> 00:23:16,720
All the credit

300
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:18,920
will be yours, Commander.

301
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:22,000
Commander Yuan,

302
00:23:22,070 --> 00:23:23,256
you are a magnanimous man.

303
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:26,119
I have nothing left
but this worthless life.

304
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:27,880
Please spare me.

305
00:23:28,559 --> 00:23:29,279
Please spare me.

306
00:23:29,559 --> 00:23:30,200
Spare me.

307
00:23:30,264 --> 00:23:31,240
Have mercy, Commander!

308
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:32,780
- Have mercy!
- Have mercy!

309
00:23:32,799 --> 00:23:33,799
Have mercy, My Lord!

310
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:34,799
Have mercy!

311
00:23:34,920 --> 00:23:35,880
His Majesty has decreed.

312
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:38,480
The traitor Zheng Baichuan and his sons,

313
00:23:38,839 --> 00:23:39,440
Zheng Qing

314
00:23:39,799 --> 00:23:40,519
and Zheng Yun,

315
00:23:41,048 --> 00:23:42,350
harbored treacherous intentions,

316
00:23:42,440 --> 00:23:43,480
defied all proper order,

317
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:45,079
and disrupted the court.

318
00:23:46,079 --> 00:23:48,160
The law and discipline must be upheld.

319
00:23:48,799 --> 00:23:49,480
All male members

320
00:23:49,592 --> 00:23:50,880
are to be executed immediately.

321
00:23:51,176 --> 00:23:52,000
All female members

322
00:23:52,168 --> 00:23:54,264
are to be consigned
to the Imperial Music Bureau.

323
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:02,960
My Lord, I'm innocent!

324
00:24:03,096 --> 00:24:04,310
Commander, I'm innocent!

325
00:24:04,344 --> 00:24:05,440
I've been falsely accused!

326
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:06,519
I'm innocent!

327
00:24:06,519 --> 00:24:07,880
Prince Han deceived me!

328
00:24:08,559 --> 00:24:09,480
I'm innocent!

329
00:24:09,799 --> 00:24:10,599
I'm innocent!

330
00:24:11,279 --> 00:24:12,319
I'm innocent!

331
00:24:12,319 --> 00:24:13,559
It was all my father's idea!

332
00:24:13,559 --> 00:24:14,960
Commander!

333
00:24:15,400 --> 00:24:16,240
I'm innocent!

334
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:17,839
I've been falsely accused!

335
00:24:18,799 --> 00:24:19,559
Let go of me!

336
00:24:19,560 --> 00:24:20,559
Commander, I'm innocent!

337
00:24:20,559 --> 00:24:21,839
Commander!

338
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:24,240
Commander!

339
00:24:39,544 --> 00:24:41,310
Once we reach the Imperial Music Bureau,

340
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:43,359
with your beauty and talents,

341
00:24:43,519 --> 00:24:44,920
you're sure to win someone's favor

342
00:24:45,319 --> 00:24:47,599
and find a way for us both to survive.

343
00:24:49,519 --> 00:24:51,720
You're the daughter of a duke's family,

344
00:24:52,119 --> 00:24:53,559
pure and respectable.

345
00:24:54,119 --> 00:24:55,359
You're nothing like those lowly

346
00:24:55,359 --> 00:24:57,039
singers and dancers.

347
00:24:58,590 --> 00:25:00,152
When the time comes, many men

348
00:25:00,184 --> 00:25:01,680
will surely take an interest in you.

349
00:25:02,319 --> 00:25:04,000
You must seize your chance.

350
00:25:16,119 --> 00:25:17,359
Mother is right.

351
00:25:19,440 --> 00:25:21,559
I'm the daughter of a duke's family,

352
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:24,400
pure and respectable.

353
00:25:43,599 --> 00:25:44,400
Everyone out!

354
00:25:45,039 --> 00:25:46,000
Move quickly!

355
00:26:07,720 --> 00:26:08,559
Put down the sword!

356
00:26:14,279 --> 00:26:15,119
Young Lady Zheng.

357
00:26:15,799 --> 00:26:16,880
Put down your weapon.

358
00:26:17,079 --> 00:26:18,400
Don't put up a pointless struggle.

359
00:26:22,720 --> 00:26:23,640
Do you want to die?

360
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:29,200
I can give you a quick death, Mother.

361
00:26:30,759 --> 00:26:31,960
Have you lost your mind?

362
00:26:32,720 --> 00:26:33,240
No!

363
00:26:33,839 --> 00:26:34,440
No!

364
00:26:34,759 --> 00:26:35,599
No!

365
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:43,920
If we dared commit treason,

366
00:26:45,839 --> 00:26:47,759
why should we fear death?

367
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:35,119
Move!

368
00:27:39,119 --> 00:27:39,519
Move!

369
00:27:47,799 --> 00:27:48,319
Ding Peng.

370
00:27:49,464 --> 00:27:50,880
Follow the Zheng family's women

371
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:52,160
to the Imperial Music Bureau.

372
00:27:52,759 --> 00:27:54,039
Tell them to look after them.

373
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:56,000
Yes.

374
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:15,480
(When my sister took her own life,)

375
00:28:16,119 --> 00:28:18,680
(she was about
the same age as Zheng Manyi,)

376
00:28:19,079 --> 00:28:21,640
(a young lady in the prime of her life,)

377
00:28:22,079 --> 00:28:24,279
(and just like that, she was gone.)

378
00:28:35,480 --> 00:28:37,519
Justice always prevails.

379
00:28:39,400 --> 00:28:41,599
Retribution never fails.

380
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:45,599
The Zheng family

381
00:28:45,880 --> 00:28:49,759
has actually met the same fate as mine.

382
00:28:59,119 --> 00:29:00,079
Back then,

383
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:04,079
when the late Emperor attacked Jinling,

384
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:10,880
my father and Zheng Baichuan
defended Jinling together.

385
00:29:13,599 --> 00:29:16,160
Zheng Baichuan
betrayed the deposed Emperor

386
00:29:17,400 --> 00:29:19,359
and surrendered the city.

387
00:29:22,039 --> 00:29:24,039
My father refused to surrender.

388
00:29:28,839 --> 00:29:30,319
The men in our family were killed,

389
00:29:32,039 --> 00:29:32,960
and the women

390
00:29:34,319 --> 00:29:36,119
were sent to the Imperial Music Bureau.

391
00:29:41,039 --> 00:29:42,240
Don't touch my daughter!

392
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:44,160
Mother

393
00:29:45,519 --> 00:29:46,480
and my sister

394
00:29:48,359 --> 00:29:49,880
refused to suffer such humiliation

395
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:51,790
and threw themselves into the river.

396
00:29:51,880 --> 00:29:53,240
The Shen family would rather break

397
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:55,359
than bend.

398
00:29:55,599 --> 00:29:58,200
I have never regretted
marrying into the Shen family.

399
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:01,359
Let me see you off one last time.

400
00:30:02,559 --> 00:30:04,000
I was young then

401
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:08,039
and somehow survived
in confusion until now.

402
00:30:14,920 --> 00:30:16,720
It's been twenty-three years.

403
00:30:23,519 --> 00:30:25,000
I can no longer remember

404
00:30:27,759 --> 00:30:29,759
what Father, Mother,

405
00:30:29,920 --> 00:30:32,039
or my brothers looked like.

406
00:30:33,319 --> 00:30:34,960
I only vaguely remember

407
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:39,039
that my sister was very gentle.

408
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:43,440
At the Imperial Music Bureau,

409
00:30:44,440 --> 00:30:46,519
we rarely got to have meat porridge.

410
00:30:47,960 --> 00:30:48,839
My sister

411
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:51,400
would always pick out the meat

412
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:54,319
piece by piece

413
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:57,680
and put it in my bowl.

414
00:31:09,799 --> 00:31:10,759
No more sadness.

415
00:31:12,680 --> 00:31:13,599
No more sadness.

416
00:31:17,359 --> 00:31:18,880
The late Emperor is dead.

417
00:31:20,440 --> 00:31:22,279
Zheng Baichuan is dead, too.

418
00:31:22,680 --> 00:31:23,799
That's a good thing.

419
00:31:24,519 --> 00:31:25,599
We should be happy.

420
00:31:25,839 --> 00:31:27,359
We should all be happy.

421
00:31:31,720 --> 00:31:32,920
In the play,

422
00:31:34,839 --> 00:31:38,160
the Mountain Deity
upholds justice for Tanniang

423
00:31:38,680 --> 00:31:40,319
and punishes the corrupt official.

424
00:31:40,519 --> 00:31:43,720
But what about real people like us?

425
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:47,039
My father and yours

426
00:31:47,359 --> 00:31:50,559
were both loyal to the sovereign
and defended the city.

427
00:31:51,119 --> 00:31:53,559
What did they do wrong?

428
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:55,480
And if they did nothing wrong,

429
00:31:57,000 --> 00:32:00,680
then who will uphold justice for us

430
00:32:01,559 --> 00:32:03,680
and punish the Emperor?

431
00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:07,680
Lu Zongbai.

432
00:32:08,200 --> 00:32:10,640
Everyone says you're learned.

433
00:32:11,119 --> 00:32:12,319
Tell me,

434
00:32:12,559 --> 00:32:13,519
why?

435
00:32:24,759 --> 00:32:25,559
Lanxiang.

436
00:32:27,920 --> 00:32:29,319
This master of yours

437
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:32,279
isn't learned enough.

438
00:32:33,559 --> 00:32:35,200
He doesn't understand anything.

439
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:40,759
Furong is drunk.

440
00:32:40,960 --> 00:32:44,200
Take her to your place for the night.

441
00:32:45,039 --> 00:32:47,200
She'll be fine

442
00:32:47,400 --> 00:32:48,799
once she sobers up tomorrow.

443
00:32:50,720 --> 00:32:51,519
All right.

444
00:33:00,400 --> 00:33:01,680
Sister.

445
00:33:09,079 --> 00:33:10,079
(Sister.)

446
00:33:28,040 --> 00:33:30,790
(Tonight, we sisters will sit
by the fire and talk into the night.)

447
00:33:31,192 --> 00:33:32,720
(I promise you'll have your fill.)

448
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:34,519
(It's a promise.)

449
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:36,920
(We'll see each other tonight.)

450
00:33:37,519 --> 00:33:38,279
(We will.)

451
00:34:27,119 --> 00:34:28,079
Is she asleep?

452
00:34:29,559 --> 00:34:30,480
She's asleep.

453
00:34:34,440 --> 00:34:36,559
It's not even a festival
or special occasion.

454
00:34:37,119 --> 00:34:38,639
How did she get so drunk?

455
00:34:40,440 --> 00:34:41,760
We got carried away

456
00:34:42,199 --> 00:34:43,599
and had a few extra drinks.

457
00:34:47,679 --> 00:34:48,320
Perfect timing.

458
00:34:50,599 --> 00:34:51,480
Try this on.

459
00:35:03,360 --> 00:35:04,159
It's beautiful.

460
00:35:05,159 --> 00:35:05,840
Do you like it?

461
00:35:08,519 --> 00:35:09,679
Let me fasten it for you.

462
00:35:35,639 --> 00:35:37,880
How could I possibly
wear so many clothes?

463
00:35:38,040 --> 00:35:40,030
Mother, don't strain
your eyes sewing so late.

464
00:35:40,320 --> 00:35:41,199
It's not worth it.

465
00:35:43,840 --> 00:35:44,960
Silly girl.

466
00:35:46,480 --> 00:35:48,159
This isn't just about the clothes.

467
00:35:49,559 --> 00:35:52,280
It's about how you'll
be regarded in the Lin Residence.

468
00:35:52,776 --> 00:35:54,590
There are so many people
in the Lin Residence,

469
00:35:54,670 --> 00:35:55,670
and gossip is everywhere.

470
00:35:55,680 --> 00:35:57,960
They flatter those above them
and look down on those below,

471
00:35:57,970 --> 00:35:59,590
treating people
according to their status.

472
00:36:00,360 --> 00:36:02,159
Second Young Madam
came from a humble family,

473
00:36:02,639 --> 00:36:03,920
so her dowry was modest.

474
00:36:04,360 --> 00:36:06,159
Not only did Concubine Zhou
look down on her,

475
00:36:06,239 --> 00:36:07,840
but eventually even the servants

476
00:36:08,000 --> 00:36:09,800
made trouble for her behind her back.

477
00:36:12,639 --> 00:36:13,840
Don't worry, Mother.

478
00:36:14,400 --> 00:36:15,760
If anyone mistreats me,

479
00:36:16,320 --> 00:36:17,760
I'll make sure they answer for it.

480
00:36:21,720 --> 00:36:23,110
I know you can handle yourself.

481
00:36:23,880 --> 00:36:26,559
But when all is said and done,
this marriage

482
00:36:27,800 --> 00:36:29,440
is between families of unequal standing.

483
00:36:32,719 --> 00:36:34,880
Your father and I
have put you at a disadvantage.

484
00:36:36,800 --> 00:36:38,920
I'm afraid that
once you enter the Lin Residence,

485
00:36:40,079 --> 00:36:41,400
if you're ever mistreated,

486
00:36:41,800 --> 00:36:43,920
you won't have anyone
to stand up for you.

487
00:36:48,840 --> 00:36:50,960
If the Lin family
dares mistreat Lanxiang,

488
00:36:51,079 --> 00:36:52,719
I'll fight them
with everything I've got.

489
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:55,840
There you go again,
always talking about risking your life.

490
00:36:56,119 --> 00:36:58,119
How many lives do you have to risk?

491
00:36:58,840 --> 00:37:01,000
You'll only end up
making things harder for Lanxiang,

492
00:37:01,000 --> 00:37:02,840
forcing her to find
a way to save you again.

493
00:37:39,119 --> 00:37:39,880
Father.

494
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:45,199
Mother.

495
00:37:46,264 --> 00:37:48,552
I'm not in the same position
as Second Young Madam.

496
00:37:49,639 --> 00:37:51,119
No one will dare mistreat me.

497
00:37:55,719 --> 00:37:57,800
Lanxiang is right.

498
00:38:01,320 --> 00:38:04,239
No one in the Lin family
will dare mistreat her.

499
00:38:04,679 --> 00:38:05,559
Mister Lu.

500
00:38:06,519 --> 00:38:07,519
Mister Lu.

501
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:13,000
In this world,

502
00:38:13,360 --> 00:38:15,840
everything that brings
an advantage also has a drawback,

503
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:18,119
and every drawback
can also bring an advantage.

504
00:38:20,679 --> 00:38:22,599
That imperial decree may be a cage

505
00:38:22,719 --> 00:38:25,239
that binds Lanxiang to this life,

506
00:38:27,199 --> 00:38:29,360
but if Lanxiang knows how to use it,

507
00:38:29,719 --> 00:38:32,480
it can also be her armor and her sword,

508
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:34,519
protecting her from harm.

509
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:43,639
His Majesty chose me
to marry into the Lin family.

510
00:38:44,776 --> 00:38:46,920
If anyone dares
make things difficult for me,

511
00:38:48,239 --> 00:38:50,119
they'll be defying His Majesty.

512
00:38:52,880 --> 00:38:54,000
To put it more seriously,

513
00:38:55,080 --> 00:38:57,384
they'll be going
against His Majesty's will

514
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:00,199
and showing him disrespect.

515
00:39:01,599 --> 00:39:03,199
Is... is that really true?

516
00:39:07,920 --> 00:39:08,800
Wanquan,

517
00:39:10,960 --> 00:39:12,880
I have a favor to ask.

518
00:39:16,840 --> 00:39:19,039
I've spent half my life struggling,

519
00:39:19,639 --> 00:39:21,000
with no son or daughter of my own.

520
00:39:21,360 --> 00:39:23,840
Lanxiang is my only disciple.

521
00:39:26,480 --> 00:39:28,880
On the day Lanxiang gets married,

522
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:32,079
may I sit beside you

523
00:39:32,880 --> 00:39:34,679
as her master

524
00:39:36,320 --> 00:39:38,519
and join you and Guihua

525
00:39:39,159 --> 00:39:41,039
in seeing her off?

526
00:39:42,079 --> 00:39:42,400
This...

527
00:39:42,760 --> 00:39:43,199
Sir...

528
00:39:43,559 --> 00:39:44,119
No,

529
00:39:44,519 --> 00:39:46,960
how could you call that a favor?

530
00:39:47,239 --> 00:39:49,719
You're helping us when we need it most.

531
00:39:50,119 --> 00:39:51,159
All this time,

532
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:53,920
you've done so much for us.

533
00:39:54,440 --> 00:39:57,280
We don't even know how to repay you.

534
00:39:58,000 --> 00:39:59,360
Thank you, Mister Lu.

535
00:40:00,119 --> 00:40:01,280
Thank you, Sir.

536
00:40:04,880 --> 00:40:06,119
In this world,

537
00:40:08,039 --> 00:40:10,280
we must give before we can receive,

538
00:40:10,840 --> 00:40:12,920
and only by receiving can we give.

539
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:14,480
Wanquan,

540
00:40:15,199 --> 00:40:17,159
who knows what I may gain in return?

541
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:31,119
Everyone knows

542
00:40:31,560 --> 00:40:32,800
what kind of family we are,

543
00:40:33,840 --> 00:40:35,119
and the Lin family knows as well.

544
00:40:36,200 --> 00:40:39,320
Naturally, my dowry can't compare
with that of an official's daughter,

545
00:40:39,976 --> 00:40:42,504
but there's no need to pretend
we're wealthier than we are

546
00:40:42,510 --> 00:40:44,056
and make things difficult for ourselves.

547
00:40:45,079 --> 00:40:46,880
Even if our families
aren't of equal standing,

548
00:40:46,936 --> 00:40:48,760
this marriage
was bestowed by the Emperor,

549
00:40:49,000 --> 00:40:51,000
so no one can say
I'm not a suitable match.

550
00:40:55,440 --> 00:40:56,239
Father.

551
00:40:57,599 --> 00:40:58,239
Mother.

552
00:40:59,880 --> 00:41:02,719
Stop blaming yourselves
for not being more capable.

553
00:41:03,880 --> 00:41:05,639
As long as you're both well,

554
00:41:07,519 --> 00:41:09,440
that is the greatest support
I could ever have.

555
00:41:10,400 --> 00:41:11,639
No matter when,

556
00:41:12,840 --> 00:41:14,440
I know you'll always be behind me.

557
00:41:15,719 --> 00:41:16,960
As long as

558
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:19,599
I always have a home to return to,

559
00:41:21,119 --> 00:41:23,599
I'll feel secure.

560
00:41:27,719 --> 00:41:28,519
All right.

561
00:41:29,119 --> 00:41:31,920
We won't say such
discouraging things anymore.

562
00:41:47,500 --> 00:41:48,980
(Glorify the Family Name)

563
00:41:48,980 --> 00:41:50,660
(Legacy and Glory)

564
00:41:54,039 --> 00:41:55,000
Bow.

565
00:42:03,320 --> 00:42:04,199
Rise.

566
00:42:12,860 --> 00:42:16,260
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

567
00:42:16,260 --> 00:42:19,700
♪Lightly traced cause and effect♪

568
00:42:20,540 --> 00:42:23,220
♪Half a lifetime of longing♪

569
00:42:23,220 --> 00:42:26,660
♪Returns to this moment♪

570
00:42:27,020 --> 00:42:30,460
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

571
00:42:30,540 --> 00:42:33,559
♪If the image isn't real,
what does it matter?♪

572
00:42:33,559 --> 00:42:34,880
We respectfully welcome the bride.

573
00:42:35,784 --> 00:42:37,480
May she bring harmony to the household.

574
00:42:38,559 --> 00:42:39,679
I shall gladly obey.

575
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:45,159
The ceremony is complete.

576
00:42:46,159 --> 00:42:47,840
Lead the way with lanterns.

577
00:42:48,360 --> 00:42:50,599
Go forth to welcome the bride.

578
00:42:50,599 --> 00:42:53,420
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

579
00:42:53,740 --> 00:42:58,140
♪You and I will walk there together♪

580
00:42:58,140 --> 00:43:04,460
(Upholding the Virtue
of Generations Past)

581
00:43:05,340 --> 00:43:07,500
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

582
00:43:10,872 --> 00:43:13,896
Congratulations on placing first in
the provincial examination, Scholar Han.

583
00:43:14,239 --> 00:43:16,360
I also studied at Qixia Academy,

584
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:19,360
so I know well that only after
ten years of diligent study

585
00:43:19,512 --> 00:43:21,590
could you earn a place
on the honor roll today.

586
00:43:22,840 --> 00:43:24,480
This is one of life's great joys,

587
00:43:24,584 --> 00:43:26,030
and I shouldn't spoil the occasion.

588
00:43:26,679 --> 00:43:27,320
But

589
00:43:28,199 --> 00:43:29,280
a smooth bridal procession

590
00:43:29,639 --> 00:43:31,199
is said to promise a smooth marriage.

591
00:43:32,719 --> 00:43:35,519
So I ask you and your fellow scholars

592
00:43:36,840 --> 00:43:37,639
to please make way.

593
00:43:38,159 --> 00:43:39,360
I heard the bride was a maid.

594
00:43:54,360 --> 00:43:56,039
I thought Commander Lin would say,

595
00:43:57,592 --> 00:43:59,110
"The Emperor bestowed this marriage,

596
00:44:00,239 --> 00:44:01,440
so I order you to make way."

597
00:44:17,580 --> 00:44:21,700
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

598
00:44:24,540 --> 00:44:29,060
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

599
00:44:30,340 --> 00:44:34,260
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

600
00:44:34,940 --> 00:44:37,700
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

601
00:44:38,420 --> 00:44:40,740
♪Though all the world may fade♪

602
00:44:40,740 --> 00:44:43,820
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

603
00:44:45,340 --> 00:44:49,580
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

604
00:44:52,500 --> 00:44:56,660
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

605
00:44:58,460 --> 00:45:02,020
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

606
00:45:02,020 --> 00:45:05,580
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

607
00:45:06,380 --> 00:45:12,060
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

608
00:45:12,420 --> 00:45:16,740
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

609
00:45:17,100 --> 00:45:20,060
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

610
00:45:20,060 --> 00:45:23,820
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

611
00:45:23,820 --> 00:45:26,700
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

612
00:45:26,700 --> 00:45:30,780
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

613
00:45:30,780 --> 00:45:34,140
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

614
00:45:34,140 --> 00:45:37,900
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

615
